---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Lysander Liu" description="Personal site of Lysander Liu: program delivery, AI practice notes and a digital twin." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-10">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#FCAD2A] uppercase mb-4">Personal site</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-4">Lysander Liu</h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-text-light)] text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">I deliver things. What matters to me is that it lands, not that it sounds good. This site records what I built, what I validated and what I dropped.</p>
    <dl class="mt-10">
        <div class="flex gap-4 py-3 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FCAD2A]">Now</dt><dd class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Senior Project Manager, Global Delivery, Janus Digital (Dubai)</dd></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 py-3 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FCAD2A]">Background</dt><dd class="text-[var(--color-text)]">17 years in delivery and program management: financial software, digital health, online trade fairs, smart buildings</dd></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 py-3 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FCAD2A]">Credentials</dt><dd class="text-[var(--color-text)]">PgMP · PMP</dd></div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 py-3 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FCAD2A]">Working on</dt><dd class="text-[var(--color-text)]">Turning buildings into assets AI can operate; rebuilding how I work with AI tools</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="https://lysander.bond/me/" class="block p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:border-[#FCAD2A] transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#013A7D] mb-2">Digital twin</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-light)] leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">My experience, facts and voice, organised into a twin you can talk to. Sign-in required; for my own use.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#028CDC]">Sign in →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/blog" class="block p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:border-[#FCAD2A] transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#013A7D] mb-2">Blog</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-light)] leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">What I built and what went wrong: AI tooling in practice, delivery methods, system build notes.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#028CDC]">Read →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/synapse/overview" class="block p-6 bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl hover:border-[#FCAD2A] transition-colors">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#013A7D] mb-2">Synapse (archived)</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-light)] leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4">I once built this as a strong AI team system. Validated in practice, it did not hold up. Kept as-is, as a complete record.</p>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#028CDC]">See the record →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
